{"steamAppId":3369390,"description":"🐧< add to wish list now~!\nSynopsis\nGet back your child who was kidnapped by penguins! The Final Penguin has sent his crew of snake penguins to capture you. They won't be easy to catch... Use the special camera to intercept them!\nPuzzles\nThe camera-based puzzles have been powered up!\nUse a variety of newly added gimmicks to make your way through the hotel.\nWhat kind of new tricks have been added?\nWell, you'll have to check in to find out!\nNew Penguins\nThe Snake Penguin isn’t the only one after you.\nMany penguins in this hotel have their eyes on you.\nExperience a cast of unique penguins and an unpredictable story.\nNot a Fan of Horror?\nNo worries!\nThe game is designed to be enjoyable even for those who aren’t good with horror.\nSeries\nThis game is Penguin Hotel 2, the sequel to Penguin Hotel 1.\nWe recommend playing Penguin Hotel 1 before jumping into 2.\nBut even if you've only watched a video or stream, you'll still have fun!\n🐧 (Of course, we'd love for you to buy it...)\nAbout Videoing and Distribution\n・Please include the title(Subtitle optional) of this game in the title of your video or stream.\n・Add the Steam link to the description section of your video or stream.\nOther than the above, there are no specific requirements. Please use your best judgment and act responsibly.\nWe welcome videos and streams to help more people discover this game!","short_description":"Mascot Horror: \"Penguin Hotel\" Chapter 2 The Snake Penguin is after you. Solve mysteries with a mysterious camera and push forward!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369390/header.jpg?t=1745404760","developer":"lemorion_1224","publisher":"lemorion_1224","genre":"Экшены, Приключенческие игры, Инди, Стратегии","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок"],"playerCount":0,"releaseLabel":"27 мар. 2025 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":100,"steamReviewCount":49,"screens